{"id":"odgnzkvul5534va7itbz1urcq","title":"Maiao 支持的堆叠差异合并方式","originalTitle":"Stacked diffs with Maiao","summary":"Maiao 是一个社区版工具，特别适合处理堆叠差异。使用它与传统代码托管平台（如 GitHub）协作时，可以显著减少合并冲突和审查复杂性。通过将每次变更作为单独的提交处理，开发者可以更高效地进行代码审查和合并，而无需频繁创建分支。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://entropicthoughts.com/stacked-diffs-with-maiao"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T06:43:30.355Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T06:54:24.942Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T06:54:24.942Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":45,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"65705c14-4616-4f00-88bd-b41a10836fea","title":"Maiao工具支持堆叠差异合并，减少GitHub协作冲突和审查复杂性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"65705c14-4616-4f00-88bd-b41a10836fea","title":"Maiao工具支持堆叠差异合并，减少GitHub协作冲突和审查复杂性"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"flGkxy11GpEU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}